      ['02 · AUTHOR','Who created the photograph?','Preserve photographer, assistants, digital technician, set, styling, model, hair, makeup, retouching, and commissioner records. Under U.S. guidance, do not assume a commission alone answers work-made-for-hire status.','VERIFIED',['S56','S57','S84']],
      ['03 · LICENSE','What may the house actually do?','Attach usage media, territory, term, exclusivity, crops, derivatives, credits, embargoes, archive copies, portfolio uses, and approval language. Route ownership and transfer questions to counsel with the executed agreement.','PROPOSAL',['S54','S55','S57']],
      ['04 · MEMORY','Whose archive preserves the house image?','Map negatives or RAW files, selects, contact sheets, captions, model releases, licenses, expiry, publication proofs, and preservation custody. Cultural memory may depend on a record the house does not own.','INFERENCE',['S23','S60','S89']]
